{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An arsenal of mechs - giant fighting machines that represent power and strength - opens up before you. Choose your steel gladiator and customize it by adding destructive weaponry of your choice - plasma cannons, rocket launchers or flamethrowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to destroy the enemy base, a bastion of evil forces threatening the world. But first you'll have to fight your way through a horde of their own mechs, controlled by ruthless pilots. Unleash a battle of the titans where every shot shakes the ground. Show whose mech is stronger and don't stop until the enemy fortress falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 6 unique cannons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dynamic gameplay </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568410?t=1742568801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568410?t=1742568801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568410/50516398675163ca1590f022ce2f2571dcca1201/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742568801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568410/50516398675163ca1590f022ce2f2571dcca1201/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742568801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An arsenal of mechs - giant fighting machines that represent power and strength - opens up before you. Choose your steel gladiator and customize it by adding destructive weaponry of your choice - plasma cannons, rocket launchers or flamethrowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to destroy the enemy base, a bastion of evil forces threatening the world. But first you'll have to fight your way through a horde of their own mechs, controlled by ruthless pilots. Unleash a battle of the titans where every shot shakes the ground. Show whose mech is stronger and don't stop until the enemy fortress falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 6 unique cannons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dynamic gameplay </p>","developers":["WUT Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568410/d4dfcb43f31faa7d3f8c5ce8efd213d205ee6496/header.jpg?t=1742568801","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112177,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112177/movie480.mp4?t=1741802932","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112177/movie_max.mp4?t=1741802932"},"name":"sw trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112177/3c526c81b06b4011df2a2de8bf7f70f4cdb605c2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741802932","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112177/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741802932","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112177/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741802932"}}],"name":"Spell Weaver","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li>